WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.470
- We had Jenna on this show.

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:03.520
I love your daughter, by
the way, she's so fun.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.830
I kind of feel like we were separated

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.328
at birth every time we hang out.

00:00:06.328 --> 00:00:09.840
But she mentioned that the
White House was haunted.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.630
Did you ever experience that?

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:12.810
- No, we'd never.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.780
I think Barbara and Jenna
were the ones that felt

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.300
like there was that it was haunted

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.030
and pretended like they heard voices

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:21.550
and it's probably just
the secret service talking

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.640
down the hall in another
room that they heard.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.000
But we didn't think it was haunted.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.900
We love living there,
it's a magnificent house.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.050
And it has a magnificent art collection

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.040
which was also fun to
have the chance to live

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.130
with those beautiful paintings.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:39.850
- It's definitely a beautiful house.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.780
I will say that I've
been there a few times

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.690
and living there would
have been a little daunting

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.523
for a kid, I think.
(laughing)

00:00:44.523 --> 00:00:46.470
I think, I would have been terrified.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.850
Okay, so I'm not sure if you know this,

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.790
but today is National No Dirty Dishes Day.

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.900
So who washes more dishes in your house?

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.150
I think I know this answer.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.140
You or President--
- Well you know that answer.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:57.973
- I know that answer.
(laughing)

00:00:57.973 --> 00:00:59.260
- Of course, I do.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:00.653
Of course I do.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

